Update v0.1.2 is here with a small list of important bugfixes and adjustments that will carry over to the final game. Here's the list of changes:

[b][h1]Changelog[/h1][/b]

[h2]Adjustments:[/h2]
[list]
[*]You can now name your pets!
[*]Added keyboard shortcuts to the Town Map screen;
[*]Name can now be inputed directly via keyboard on the name select screen;
[*]Added randomize buttons to character creation;
[*]Reworked the "Channel Spells" interface;
[*]Reworked the "Magic" and "Skill" interfaces when in combat;
[/list]

[h2]Bugfixes:[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed a crash when cancelling out of the confirmation screen on the "Reallocate Stats" menu;
[*]Fixed a bug that happened when trying to replace a status ailment with one of the same kind on the enemy;
[*]Fixed a bug causing stats to decrease when leveling up on specific conditions;
[/list]

I hope you've been enjoying the demo so far, and remember that player feedback is always welcome!
